    "FIRE A BARRAGE OF ENERGY THAT <style=cIsHealth>HARMS HOSTILE COMBATANTS</style> AND <style=cIsHealing>HEALS FRIENDLY COMBATANTS</style> FOR <style=cIsDamage>5x800%</style>. <style=cIsUtility>HOLD UP TO 3 CHARGES.</style>": "エネルギーの弾幕を放ち、<style=cIsHealth>敵にダメージを与え</style>、<style=cIsHealing>味方を回復する</style>。効果量は<style=cIsDamage>5x800%</style>。<style=cIsUtility>最大3チャージ。</style>",
